pe": "name", "content": "peak"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the top of a mountain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can see that many peaks have a lot of snow. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when you are in an airplane."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pilot"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person who operates an airplane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm a pilot for American Airways."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "captain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the title of a person who operates a boat or airplane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is your pilot, Captain Ferguson, speaking."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "crew"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the employees who work on a boat or airplane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are three flight attendants in the crew."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fasten"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to attach"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "verb"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fasten your seatbelts and return seats to the upright position."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "seatbelt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a strap you put around your waist in a car or airplane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please fasten your seatbelt. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overhead compartment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "place for luggage above the seat in a train or airplane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please place your luggage in the overhead compartment."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "upright"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "sitting straight up; not in a decline"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "adjective"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please return your seat to the upright position."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "descent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "going down"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "noun"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're beginning our descent into Geneva. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le04ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Imperatives on an Airplane"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Imperatives are commands or instructions. You do not use the subject with the verb.<br /> When you are on an airplane, you hear many Imperatives. The captain or crew need to tell you what to do.<br />Here are some common Imperatives you hear on an airplane:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Imperative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fasten\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to attach\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Fasten your seatbelt. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to go back to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Return to your seat. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Store\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to place something in a position\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Store your carry-on luggage in the overhead compartment. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verify\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to make sure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Verify your bags are securely stored. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Place your seat in the upright position. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Prepositions of Place"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Prepositions of place help explain where something is located. You often hear prepositions of place when you are in an airplane."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Preposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" touching the surface\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" on the ground\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"under\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" below something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" under your seat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" within an enclosed space\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in the overhead compartment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"above\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" on top of something but not touching it\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"above your head\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"around\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" going in a circle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" around your waist\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " We are now flying over the Alps. The temperature on the ground is presently 23 degrees Fahrenheit or -5 degrees Celsius. Store bags under your seat or in the overhead compartments above your head."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss what it is going to be like to fly in an airplane in the year 2050."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the pilot's announcement on this flight."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use Infinitives and prepositions of place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your announcement with the class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss travel in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write instructions using Infinitives and prepositions of place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I